    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d590">

                <pb facs="0644" n="594" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg594"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 6.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 113.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 9th instant I inclosed to you in my
                    No. 100 a copy of my note of that date to the minister of state informing him of
                    my readiness to accept the indemnity of $17,500 in the Caroline matter, subject
                    to the condition stated by you. I have to-day received his reply, a copy of
                    which I inclose herein, with translation.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hannis Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d590-a1.xml" xpointer="d590-a1"/>
